cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FlowerTrait: Colour, Pattern, Symmetry and Shape Traits of Flowers from Photographs"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahimi
    given-names: Ehsan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8401-472X"
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Chuleui
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanrahimi666/FlowerTrait"
abstract: >-
  An R package with an optional Python back end that detects and outlines
  the main flower in field photographs, screens photos with a photo filter and
  computes colour, colour-name, radial-pattern, symmetry, petal-number and shape
  traits with a catalogue of their reliability. Validated against manual
  outlines and floral reflectance spectra.
